6629 0 obj
<</Title(Using Graph Neural Networks for coding assignment plagiarism detection based on source)/Subject(Neural networks seem like a perfect fit for detecting plagiarism attempts in coding exercises. In the Rust deep learning framework burn-rs, I built a graph convolution network with subpar accuracy, After a quick recap about that, we will explore how graph isomorphism networks and different similarity metrics can be used to improve the accuracy of the model.)/Keywords(Rust, burn-rs, GNN, GCN, GIN, Plagiarism, Similarity)/Author(Tim Peko (TimerErTim))/Creator(Typst 0.15.0)/ModDate(D:20260727200837Z)/CreationDate(D:20260727200837Z)>>
endobj
